    },
    {
        "language": "Korean",
        "memberName": [
            "RM"
        ],
        "korean": "침대는 나의 관, my bed is my coffin\n어쩜 내 세상은 거대한 caffeine\n매일 널 죽으러 가\n꿈을 끌 순 없나?",
        "romanization": "chimdaeneun naye gwan, my bed is my coffini\neojjeom nae sesangeun geodaehan caffeine\nmaeil neol jugeureo ga\nkkumeul kkeul sun eomna?",
        "english": "My bed is my coffin, My bed is my coffin\nMaybe my whole world's just one big caffeine\nEvery day I go to die by you, \nCan't I just switch off this dream??",
        "startChunk": 4822,
        "isAdLib": false,
        "adLibDuration": 0,
        "anchorMode": "startChunk"
    },
    {
        "language": "Korean",
        "memberName": [
            "RM"
        ],
        "korean": "멈출 수 없는 춤을 추고 있잖아\n또 생각에, 생각에, 생각에 생각",
        "romanization": "meomchul su eomneun chumeul chugo itjana\ntto saenggage, saenggage, saenggage saenggak",
        "english": "'Cause I'm doing a dance I can't stop\nAgain, thoughts on thoughts on thoughts on thoughts",
        "startChunk": 5056,
        "isAdLib": false,
        "adLibDuration": 0,
        "anchorMode": "startChunk"
    },
    {
        "language": "Korean",
        "memberName": [
            "RM"
        ],
        "korean": "생각하지 말잔 생각을 해 난\n빙글 또 빙글 행복하니?\n웃어줘 끝까지",
        "romanization": "saenggak haji maljan saengageul hae nan\nbinggeul tto binggeul haengbok hani?\nuseojweo kkeutkkaji",
        "english": "I'm thinking about how to stop thinking\nSpinning and spinning, are you happy?\nKeep smiling 'til it's over",
        "startChunk": 5202,
        "isAdLib": false,
        "adLibDuration": 0,
        "anchorMode": "startChunk"
    }
